{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Mpumbavu anasema moyoni mwake,"},{"verse":2,"text":"Mungu anawachungulia wanadamu chini"},{"verse":3,"text":"Kila mmoja amegeukia mbali,"},{"verse":4,"text":"Je, watendao mabaya kamwe hawatajifunza:"},{"verse":5,"text":"Hapo waliingiwa na hofu kuu,"},{"verse":6,"text":"Laiti wokovu wa Israeli ungalikuja kutoka Sayuni!"}]}